    "## 3. Loading and preprocessing the data\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset is composed in three parts: the **one-shot support set** (the only labeled training images), an **augmented support dataset** (many views of those same 16 images), and the **test set**. Images stay as RGB PIL images because each foundation model's own processor handles resizing and normalization, so no image-size or patch-size settings are needed here.\n",
    "\n",
    "## No use of unlabeled data\n",
    "\n",
    "The assignment states we can only use a single image for training. As such no validation is used and the same image is used from \"different\" perspectives."
   ]
